nt behavior, or repository-wide completeness.","facts":[{"id":"fu-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The supplied source declares the update-item handler and its execution body.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":75,"endLine":82}]},{"id":"fu-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler receives current_user as its caller identity input.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":76,"endLine":81}]},{"id":"fu-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler loads the existing item identified by id before authorization and mutation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":86,"endLine":88}]},{"id":"fu-authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler rejects a non-superuser whose loaded item is not owned by current_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":89,"endLine":90}]},{"id":"fu-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The item update, persistence, and response occur only after the authorization check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":91,"endLine":96}]},{"id":"fu-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The visible authorization condition distinguishes the superuser bypass from the owner match requirement.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":89,"endLine":90}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]},{"obligationId":"scenario%3Asuperuser-read::entry%3Aread-item-handler","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"allow"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared read handler entry, the supplied source binds current_user and loads the existing item by id. For the stated authenticated active superuser and foreign-owner premises, the visible authorization control does not reject: the owner-mismatch denial is guarded by not current_user.is_superuser. The protected effect, returning the loaded item, is therefore reachable, so the source-visible behavior is allow. This matches the accepted policy judgment that an active superuser may read a foreign-owned item. The requested policy-preserving change is to retain this active-superuser bypass while keeping the non-superuser owner restriction. No source-external binding is decisive within this declared-entry boundary because the scenario premises supply the identity and ownership facts; this assessment does not infer upstream injection, deployment behavior, or repository-wide completeness.","facts":[{"id":"sr-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The supplied source declares the read-item handler and its execution body.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":48,"endLine":50}]},{"id":"sr-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler receives current_user as its caller identity input.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":49,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"sr-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler loads the existing item identified by id before applying the authorization decision.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":53,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"sr-authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler denies only when the caller is not a superuser and the loaded item is not owned by current_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"sr-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The loaded item is returned after the authorization control permits execution.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":58}]},{"id":"sr-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The visible authorization condition provides an active-superuser bypass for the owner mismatch.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3255,"output":1274,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":46896.53659999999,